{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0430"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge earth-space/astronomy","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/earth-space__astronomy.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",170],["+","The first four, the rocky or terrestrial planets with solid surfaces of silicate rock around iron cores, make a shorter list of their own; quizmasters often ask for just three of them, so the answer reads Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars (any three). "],["=",615]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",166],["+","Die ersten vier, die Gesteins- oder erdähnlichen Planeten mit festen Oberflächen aus Silikatgestein um Eisenkerne, bilden eine eigene, kürzere Liste; Quizfragen verlangen oft nur drei von ihnen, und so lautet die Antwort Merkur, Venus, Erde, Mars (drei davon). "],["=",615]]}]},
